\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131658975448666112695320.jpeg/TcMITORdjxsF4Ml3JOnlaKjk515Wz_QpRcr6ClPK-go\" alt=\"有青馬管制區職員陪同送院。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>有青馬管制區職員陪同送院。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131658978732937216206138.jpeg/ppQYdvy3ZyrgABfFe2foJlg7cHgHXIPfNT36ByM9-gc\" alt=\"警員到醫院調查事件。（梁偉權攝）\"><figcaption>警員到醫院調查事件。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T13:47:20.812537+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1127,"images":15,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}